            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>At the moment of the audit, we noticed air leakage from the following components:

- All windows frame

- Receptacles

- All doors. The basement door is in bad shape. There is a big gap between the door frame and the weather strips. This situation causes high air leakage around the door.

Other than the leakage observed, the airtightness of the house is not catastrophic. Unfortunately, even if the result is not high, this situation can cause an increase in energy required to heat the house.



WINDOWS: We noticed air leakage from the windows frame. We recommend sealing all units.



DOORS: We noticed air leakage around the doors. We recommend the installation of weather strips to seal the units. Special attention is required for the exterior door located in the basement. The air leakage of this door is very high, we recommend to seal the unit.

</airSeal>
                <windows />
                <doors />
            </RURComments>
